 Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"This is getting ridiculous, Mr. President.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":122,"nodeId":44}]},"44":{"id":44,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"The Constitution is not a toy. You can't just play with it and change it however you like.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":122,"nodeId":45}]},"45":{"id":45,"speaker":"Lileas Graf","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"With all due respect, I believe you are not seeing things clearly anymore, Mr. President. I'm concerned about you.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":122,"nodeId":46}]},"46":{"id":46,"speaker":"Narrator","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"As Petr was about to respond, Gus cut in.","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":122,"nodeId":47}]},"47":{"id":47,"speaker":"Gus Manger","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"In this rare occasion, I have to admit that I agree with Mrs. Graf here. It's important not to get ahead of ourselves.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":122,"nodeId":48}]},"48":{"id":48,"speaker":"Gus Manger","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"Sordish reality is quite different than what's being said here. Let's not kid ourselves.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":122,"nodeId":60},{"convId":122,"nodeId":65},{"convId":122,"nodeId":64}]},"49":{"id":49,"speaker":"Ciara Walda","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"I believe the decision that led to these investigations was taken without the counsel of Council of Ministers.\"","conditionsRaw":null,"variablesRead":[],"variablesModified":[],"outgoingIds":[{"convId":122,"nodeId":50}]},"50":{"id":50,"speaker":"Ciara Walda","isPlayerChoice":false,"text":"\"And there is only one signature on tha